{
  "key": 13387,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "ValorCavern_Text_SaturnMissionIsProceeding",
      "en_US": [
        "The mission is proceeding without\n",
        "a hitch. The boss should be pleased.\r",
        "Everything is for everyone, and\n",
        "for the good of Team Galactic!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValorCavern_Text_SaturnBattleIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I recognize your face!\r",
        "You’re the child who raided the Team\n",
        "Galactic building in Eterna!\r",
        "Humph! Jupiter should be ashamed of\n",
        "herself, being beaten by a child.\r",
        "But anything and anyone that opposes\n",
        "Team Galactic must be crushed!\r",
        "Even the very thought of opposition\n",
        "will not be tolerated!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValorCavern_Text_SaturnPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Gah! Even I, a Commander, only\n",
        "managed to buy us time?\r",
        "But that’s fine.\r",
        "A child like you will never be able to\n",
        "stem the flow of time!\r",
        "Team Galactic will get the three\n",
        "legendary Pokémon of the lakes!\r",
        "With their power, we will create an\n",
        "entirely new universe!\r",
        "By now, Mars should have captured\n",
        "the Pokémon of Lake Verity...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValorCavern_Text_PaulTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Two of them. Figures.\r",
        "We finish this together. Don’t\n",
        "hold back now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValorCavern_Text_PaulFarewell",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s that.\r",
        "To think that Team Galactic would\n",
        "destroy a whole lake just to capture\f",
        "a single Pokémon.\r",
        "Usually I don’t care for Pokémon that\n",
        "can’t battle. They’re pathetic.\r",
        "But...\r",
        "Hmph, anyways.\r",
        "You didn’t drag me down. I’ll give\n",
        "you that much.\r",
        "Don’t expect me to go easy next time\n",
        "we meet. Later."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
